AT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"easy","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"irrational_sum_of_roots","group":null,"passage":"Consider the equation shown.\n\n$x^2 - 8x - 38 = 0$","question":"What is the sum of the solutions to the equation shown?","options":["38","-8","8","-38"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"판별식 D = b² - 4ac = 216는 완전제곱수가 아니므로 두 근은 무리수다. 하지만 근의 합은 항상 유리수인 -b/a로 구할 수 있다: -(-8)/1 = 8. 근을 직접 구해 더할 필요가 없다.","explanationEn":"The discriminant D = b² - 4ac = 216 is not a perfect square, so the two roots are irrational. But the sum of the roots is always the rational value -b/a: -(-8)/1 = 8. There is no need to compute the individual roots.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T00:03:00.311Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"medium","requestedDifficulty":"medium","difficultyReasons":[],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"2026-10-19T23:55:29.010Z","mockExamGeneration":{"runId":"sat-error-report-1018","gid":"e1018-t1-math_m2-25","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":null,"recipeCheck":null,"hardBasis":null,"difficultyStatus":null,"review":null}}},{"gid":"e1018-t10-math_m2-44","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"medium","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"linear_quadratic_intersection","group":null,"passage":"The graphs of a quadratic function and a linear function are shown in the xy-plane below.","question":"What is the x-coordinate of the intersection point of the two graphs shown?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-2"],"explanation":"그래프의 두 곡선은 y = -2x² - x - 13, y = 7x - 5이다. 두 식을 같다고 놓으면 -2x² - x - 13 = 7x - 5이고, 정리하면 -2x² - 8x - 8 = 0이다. 이 식은 (x + 2)² = 0 형태로 인수분해되어 중근 x = -2을 갖는다(직선이 포물선에 한 점에서 접한다). 따라서 교점의 x좌표는 -2이다.","explanationEn":"The two graphs are y = -2x² - x - 13 and y = 7x - 5. Setting the two expressions equal gives -2x² - x - 13 = 7x - 5, which simplifies to -2x² - 8x - 8 = 0. This factors as (x + 2)² = 0, a repeated root x = -2 (the line is tangent to the parabola at one point). So the x-coordinate of the intersection point is -2.","figure":{"type":"plane","axes":{"x":{"min":-9,"max":9},"y":{"min":-220,"max":94}},"objects":[{"id":"q","kind":"function","fn":"quadratic","params":[-2,-1,-13]},{"id":"l","kind":"line","slope":7,"intercept":-5}],"grid":true},"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T00:03:00.311Z","issues":[],"alt":"좌표평면(x -9~9, y -220~94). q: y = −2x² − x − 13; 직선 l: y = 7x − 5."},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"medium","requestedDifficulty":"medium","difficultyReasons":[],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"2026-10-19T23:55:29.010Z","mockExamGeneration":{"runId":"sat-error-report-1018","gid":"e1018-t10-math_m2-44","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":null,"recipeCheck":null,"hardBasis":null,"difficultyStatus":null,"review":null}}},{"gid":"e1018-t12-math_m2-64","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"systems_linear","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"intersection_x","group":null,"passage":"The